"User app caches" = "Cache aplikasi pengguna";
"Temporary data apps keep to load faster. Apps recreate it automatically when needed." = "Data sementara yang disimpan aplikasi agar lebih cepat dimuat. Aplikasi membuatnya ulang otomatis saat diperlukan.";
"Some apps may start a little slower the first time" = "Beberapa aplikasi mungkin sedikit lebih lambat saat pertama dibuka";
"User logs & crash reports" = "Log & laporan crash pengguna";
"Diagnostic text files written by apps. Only needed when you are reporting a bug." = "File teks diagnostik yang ditulis aplikasi. Hanya diperlukan saat Anda melaporkan bug.";
"Safari cache" = "Cache Safari";
"Copies of web pages and images. Safari downloads them again when you visit a site. History, bookmarks and logins are not touched." = "Salinan halaman web dan gambar. Safari mengunduhnya lagi saat Anda mengunjungi situs. Riwayat, bookmark, dan login tidak disentuh.";
"Google Chrome cache" = "Cache Google Chrome";
"Copies of web pages and images. Chrome downloads them again when you visit a site. History, bookmarks and logins are not touched." = "Salinan halaman web dan gambar. Chrome mengunduhnya lagi saat Anda mengunjungi situs. Riwayat, bookmark, dan login tidak disentuh.";
"Trash" = "Tong Sampah";
"Files you already moved to the Trash. They stay restorable from the Restore Center for the retention period." = "File yang sudah Anda pindahkan ke Tong Sampah. File tetap bisa dipulihkan dari Pusat Pemulihan selama masa simpan.";
"Xcode DerivedData" = "DerivedData Xcode";
"Build intermediates and indexes. Xcode rebuilds them on the next build." = "File antara build dan indeks. Xcode membuatnya ulang pada build berikutnya.";
"Next build and indexing take longer" = "Build dan pengindeksan berikutnya lebih lama";
"iOS DeviceSupport" = "iOS DeviceSupport";
"Debug symbols copied from devices you connected. Xcode copies them again the next time you debug on that device and OS version." = "Simbol debug yang disalin dari perangkat yang pernah Anda sambungkan. Xcode menyalinnya lagi saat Anda men-debug di perangkat dan versi OS itu.";
"Reconnecting a device takes several minutes" = "Menyambungkan ulang perangkat butuh beberapa menit";
"Simulator caches" = "Cache simulator";
"Cached data for iOS simulators (dyld and runtime caches). Simulators rebuild it on next launch. Your simulator apps and data are not touched." = "Data cache untuk simulator iOS (cache dyld dan runtime). Simulator membuatnya ulang saat dibuka berikutnya. Aplikasi dan data simulator Anda tidak disentuh.";
"Homebrew downloads" = "Unduhan Homebrew";
"Downloaded bottles and source archives. Homebrew downloads them again if it needs them. Installed packages are not touched." = "Bottle dan arsip sumber yang diunduh. Homebrew mengunduhnya lagi jika diperlukan. Package yang terpasang tidak disentuh.";
"npm cache" = "Cache npm";
"npm's download cache. Packages are fetched again on the next install. Your projects' node_modules are not touched." = "Cache unduhan npm. Package diambil lagi saat instalasi berikutnya. node_modules di proyek Anda tidak disentuh.";
"Next npm install downloads packages again" = "npm install berikutnya mengunduh package lagi";
"Yarn cache" = "Cache Yarn";
"Yarn's download cache. Packages are fetched again on the next install." = "Cache unduhan Yarn. Package diambil lagi saat instalasi berikutnya.";
"pip cache" = "Cache pip";
"pip's download and wheel cache. Packages are fetched again on the next install. Installed packages and virtual environments are not touched." = "Cache unduhan dan wheel pip. Package diambil lagi saat instalasi berikutnya. Package yang terpasang dan virtual environment tidak disentuh.";
"CocoaPods cache" = "Cache CocoaPods";
"Downloaded pod sources. CocoaPods fetches them again on the next pod install." = "Sumber pod yang diunduh. CocoaPods mengambilnya lagi saat pod install berikutnya.";
"Go build cache" = "Cache build Go";
"Compiled Go packages. Go rebuilds them on the next build." = "Package Go yang sudah dikompilasi. Go membuatnya ulang pada build berikutnya.";
"Cargo registry downloads" = "Unduhan registry Cargo";
"Downloaded crate archives. Cargo downloads them again when a build needs them." = "Arsip crate yang diunduh. Cargo mengunduhnya lagi saat build memerlukannya.";
"Gradle caches" = "Cache Gradle";
"Downloaded dependencies and build caches. Gradle fetches them again, which can take a long time on big projects." = "Dependensi yang diunduh dan cache build. Gradle mengambilnya lagi, yang bisa lama di proyek besar.";
"Next Gradle build downloads dependencies again" = "Build Gradle berikutnya mengunduh dependensi lagi";
